    <string name="not_paired">Not paired with a Mac yet</string>
    <string name="not_paired_detail">Open ExtendPad on your Mac and plug in the USB cable. The Mac opens this app automatically and pairs it over USB.</string>
    <string name="rejected">The Mac rejected this tablet</string>
    <string name="rejected_detail">%1$s\nUnplug and replug the cable (or click Connect on the Mac) to pair again.</string>
    <string name="instructions">1. On the tablet: Settings → About tablet → tap “Build number” 7× to unlock Developer options.\n2. Developer options → enable USB debugging (Huawei: also “Allow ADB debugging in charge only mode”).\n3. Connect the tablet to the Mac with a USB-C data cable and tap “Allow” on the debugging prompt.\n4. Start ExtendPad on the Mac and click Connect. Everything else is automatic.</string>
